OL,3,ABadenoch says Tories would scrap
OL,4,Ainheritance tax on family homes and
OL,5,Aincrease couples' threshold to #1m
OL,6,
OL,7,FConservative leader Kemi Badenoch is
OL,8,Faddressing her party's conference in
OL,9,FBirmingham - you can watch the speech
OL,10,Flive above
OL,12,FShe says a future Tory government will
OL,13,Fmake changes to inheritance tax,
OL,14,Fmeaning people will be able to pass on
OL,15,Ftheir family homes without paying the
OL,16,Flevy, plus an extra #1m tax-free for
OL,17,Fcouples.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
PN,30202
