OL,3,ABadenoch says Tories would scrap
OL,4,Ainheritance tax on family homes and
OL,5,Aincrease couples' threshold to #1m
OL,6,
OL,7,FShe refers to the party's proposal to
OL,8,Fcut employer National Insurance
OL,9,Fcontributions for workers aged 21 to
OL,10,F24, saying "that is how you get young
OL,11,Fpeople into work, by making it easier
OL,12,Fto hire them"
